# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:23
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_93cbf6b1:

    # "I drive over to Adrian's house to pick her up, then she gives me directions to get to this arcade she wants to visit."
    "Vado in macchina a casa di Adrian per passare a prenderla, poi lei mi dà le indicazioni per arrivare alla sala giochi che vuole visitare."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:25
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_ef349499:

    # "I drive over to Adrian's house and pick her up, then we head out to the arcade."
    "Vado in macchina a casa di Adrian e la vado a prendere, poi ci dirigiamo alla sala giochi."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:30
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_049af941:

    # gg "Wow, look at this place! It's so retro and trashy."
    gg "Wow, guarda che posto! È così retrò e trasandato."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:31
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_ca89a42d:

    # gg "I love it!"
    gg "Lo adoro!"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:32
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_1b8393bf:

    # pc "Is this like the business you want to start?"
    pc "È questo il tipo di attività che vorresti avviare?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:33
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_cb319d99:

    # gg "Hm, not really. I'm looking to appeal to a younger crowd, with newer games and private playing areas."
    gg "Hm, non proprio. Sto cercando di attirare un pubblico più giovane, con giochi più recenti e aree di gioco private."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:34
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_1dc6627f:

    # gg "These are all old machines, pretty beat up too. I love them, but I doubt their business is booming here."
    gg "Queste sono tutte macchine vecchie, e anche piuttosto malridotte. Le adoro, ma dubito che qui gli affari vadano a gonfie vele."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:35
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_b342ddbc:

    # gg "Anyway..."
    gg "Comunque..."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:36
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_ce26e6ca:

    # gg "Let's go play some games!"
    gg "Andiamo a giocare un po’!"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:37
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_5d89bf80:

    # "We head over to the machines."
    "Ci dirigiamo verso le macchine."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:44
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_fcc66601:

    # "We chat while we play games together."
    "Chiacchieriamo mentre giochiamo insieme."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:51
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_aa98635a:

    # "It's fun just to hang out with her. She obviously loves this stuff."
    "È divertente anche solo passare del tempo con lei. È ovvio che adori questa roba."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:60
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_b0953d82:

    # gg "That was fun. You're pretty good at these old games."
    gg "È stato divertente. Sei piuttosto brava con questi vecchi giochi."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:61
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_98d42c74:

    # pc "Thanks! I used to play these types of games with my dad as a kid all the time."
    pc "Grazie! Da bambina giocavo sempre a questo genere di giochi con mio padre."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:62
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_fb8d8dab:

    # "After we get our fill, playing most of the games in the place several times, we're both ready to leave."
    "Dopo esserci divertite a sazietà, giocando più volte alla maggior parte dei giochi presenti nel locale, siamo entrambe pronte ad andarcene."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:66
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_96accbe9:

    # gg "That was fun!"
    gg "È stato divertente!"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:68
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_1e0d4722:

    # pc "Did you get the research you need?"
    pc "Hai trovato le informazioni che ti servivano?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:69
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_d081eccb:

    # gg "Yeah, I think so."
    gg "Sì, credo di sì."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:72
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_57656827:

    # gg "Want to take me home and research me now?"
    gg "Vuoi accompagnarmi a casa e fare qualche ricerca su di me adesso?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:73
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_82ba066c:

    # pc "That sounds fantastic."
    pc "Sembra fantastico."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianDates/adrianarcadedate.rpy:79
translate italian adrianarcadestartdate_05218083:

    # "We leave the arcade, then I drive her home and walk her up to her front door."
    "Usciamo dalla sala giochi, poi la accompagno a casa in auto e la accompagno fino alla porta di casa."

